{"year":1980,"papers":[{"id":"1980/全国","title":"1980年全国","region":"全国","count":19}],"questions":[{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"1","title":"1980年全国高考第 1 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"力物体的平衡","points":["重力"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_0a7d42989ddb51cbb7dcee72637a99e4","body":"月球表面上的重力加速度为地球表面上的重力加速度的 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{1}{6}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{1}{6}</span>，一个质量为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"600\\Ukg\" data-display=\"0\">600\\Ukg</span> 的飞行器在月球表面上<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> 质量是 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"100\\Ukg\" data-display=\"0\">100\\Ukg</span>，重力是 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"5880\\UN\" data-display=\"0\">5880\\UN</span></li><li><b>B.</b> 质量是 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"100\\Ukg\" data-display=\"0\">100\\Ukg</span>，重量是 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"980\\UN\" data-display=\"0\">980\\UN</span></li><li><b>C.</b> 质量是 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"600\\Ukg\" data-display=\"0\">600\\Ukg</span>，重量是 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"980\\UN\" data-display=\"0\">980\\UN</span></li><li><b>D.</b> 质量是 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"600\\Ukg\" data-display=\"0\">600\\Ukg</span>，重量是 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"5880\\UN\" data-display=\"0\">5880\\UN</span></li></ul>","answer":"C","memo":"因为质量是物体的固有属性，不随位置的改变而改变，所以质量仍然为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"600\\Ukg\" data-display=\"0\">600\\Ukg</span>，故 AB 错误；由于在月球表面的重力是地球表面重力的 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{1}{6}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{1}{6}</span>，所以飞行器在月球表面的重力 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"G_{\\text{月}}=m\\times\\frac{1}{6}g_{\\text{地}}=980\\UN\" data-display=\"0\">G_{\\text{月}}=m\\times\\frac{1}{6}g_{\\text{地}}=980\\UN</span>，故 C 正确 D 错误。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"2","title":"1980年全国高考第 2 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"力物体的平衡","points":["受力分析"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_b4e25d7ba36c543e90a73501687847fa","body":"一架梯子斜靠在光滑的竖直墙上，下端放在水平的粗糙地面上。下面是梯子受力情况的简单描述，哪一句是正确的？梯子受到<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> 两个竖直的力，一个水平的力</li><li><b>B.</b> 一个竖直的力，两个水平的力</li><li><b>C.</b> 两个竖直的力，两个水平的力</li><li><b>D.</b> 三个竖直的力，两个水平的力</li></ul>","answer":"C","memo":"对梯子受力分析知，如图所示，梯子受到竖直向下的重力，竖直向上的地面支持力、水平方向墙面的弹力和地面的静摩擦力的作用，故 C 正确。<br><br><div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/ec3d99ffce93f802eb85a174.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/ec3d99ffce93f802eb85a174.png\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"3","title":"1980年全国高考第 3 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"电路","points":["电容"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_7699920705c25a0280a3a2effaf2b8f6","body":"一个平行板电容器，它的电容<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> 跟正对的面积成正比，跟两板间的距离成正比</li><li><b>B.</b> 跟正对的面积成正比，跟两板间的距离成反比</li><li><b>C.</b> 跟正对的面积成反比，跟两板间的距离成正比</li><li><b>D.</b> 跟正对的面积成反比，跟两板间的距离成反比</li></ul>","answer":"B","memo":"由平行板电容器的决定式 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"C=\\frac{\\varepsilon S}{4\\pi kd}\" data-display=\"0\">C=\\frac{\\varepsilon S}{4\\pi kd}</span> 知，电容的大小跟正对的面积成正比，跟板间距成反比，故 B 正确。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"4","title":"1980年全国高考第 4 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"交流电","points":["交流电"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_e1d71f3d1a09546a809da397b08dd61a","body":"把 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"220\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">220\\UV</span> 的交流电压加在 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"440\\UO\" data-display=\"0\">440\\UO</span> 的电阻上，在电阻上<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> 电压的有效值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"220\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">220\\UV</span>，电流的有效值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.5\\UA\" data-display=\"0\">0.5\\UA</span></li><li><b>B.</b> 电压的最大值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"220\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">220\\UV</span>，电流的有效值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.5\\UA\" data-display=\"0\">0.5\\UA</span></li><li><b>C.</b> 电压的有效值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"220\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">220\\UV</span>，电流的最大值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.5\\UA\" data-display=\"0\">0.5\\UA</span></li><li><b>D.</b> 电压的最大值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"220\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">220\\UV</span>，电流的最大值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.5\\UA\" data-display=\"0\">0.5\\UA</span></li></ul>","answer":"A","memo":"<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"220\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">220\\UV</span> 的交流电压指交流电压的有效值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"220\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">220\\UV</span>，电压的最大值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"220\\sqrt{2}\\UV\\approx311\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">220\\sqrt{2}\\UV\\approx311\\UV</span>，故 BD 错误；将该交流电压加在 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"440\\UO\" data-display=\"0\">440\\UO</span> 的电阻上，通过电阻的电流为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"I=\\frac{220}{440}\\UA=0.5\\UA\" data-display=\"0\">I=\\frac{220}{440}\\UA=0.5\\UA</span>，该电流的最大值为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.5\\sqrt{2}\\UA\" data-display=\"0\">0.5\\sqrt{2}\\UA</span>，故 A 正确 C 错误。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"5","title":"1980年全国高考第 5 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"光学","points":["全反射"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_68d75b813a865a0b9cad9c1b8aa21560","body":"某媒质对空气的折射率为 1.414，一束光从媒质射向空气，入射角为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"60^{\\circ}\" data-display=\"0\">60^{\\circ}</span>。它的光路图是<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> <figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/d3d9d2865e8295e6f8d97c55.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/d3d9d2865e8295e6f8d97c55.svg\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A</figcaption></figure></li><li><b>B.</b> <figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/b850dcb45f9cc7109c6404ab.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/b850dcb45f9cc7109c6404ab.svg\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>B</figcaption></figure></li><li><b>C.</b> <figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/4be19c6681d503354a9d9725.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/4be19c6681d503354a9d9725.svg\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>C</figcaption></figure></li><li><b>D.</b> <figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/304be263018f195392238170.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/304be263018f195392238170.svg\" alt=\"D\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>D</figcaption></figure></li></ul>","answer":"D","memo":"光线从折射率为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\sqrt{2}\" data-display=\"0\">\\sqrt{2}</span> 的介质中射向空气，发生全反射的临界角为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\sin C=\\frac{1}{n}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\sin 45^{\\circ}\" data-display=\"0\">\\sin C=\\frac{1}{n}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\sin 45^{\\circ}</span>，由于入射角为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"60^{\\circ}\" data-display=\"0\">60^{\\circ}</span>，大于临界角，故会发生全反射，只有反射光线，故 D 正确。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"6","title":"1980年全国高考第 6 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"直线运动","points":["运动图象"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_d3f9ee0b196b5430b214d394fd901fd4","body":"物体竖直上抛后又落向地面，设向上的速度为正，它在整个运动过程中速度 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 跟时间 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"t\" data-display=\"0\">t</span> 的关系是<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> <figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/9fe9f808040b28283cbdd988.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/9fe9f808040b28283cbdd988.svg\" alt=\"A\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A</figcaption></figure></li><li><b>B.</b> <figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/4ca58e3ec11f9a0f071ba48a.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/4ca58e3ec11f9a0f071ba48a.svg\" alt=\"B\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>B</figcaption></figure></li><li><b>C.</b> <figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/3091248803919a215be789da.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/3091248803919a215be789da.svg\" alt=\"C\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>C</figcaption></figure></li><li><b>D.</b> <figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/6818321fd1a269e26f49b582.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/6818321fd1a269e26f49b582.svg\" alt=\"D\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>D</figcaption></figure></li></ul>","answer":"B","memo":"A 图表示物体先向上匀减速运动，后向上匀加速运动，不符合物体的实际运动情况，故 A 错误；B 图表示物体先向上做匀减速直线运动，后向下做匀加速直线运动，加速度不变，故 B 正确；C 图表示物体先向下做匀减速运动，后向上做匀加速运动，不符合物体的实际运动情况，故 C 错误；D 图表示速度均为正值，表示物体速度方向不变，不符合物体的实际运动情况，故 D 错误。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"7","title":"1980年全国高考第 7 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"电场","points":["电势能电势差电场力做功"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_233d00ed021652189fb038e3d20386af","body":"在电场中，A 点的电势高于 B 点的电势，<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> 把负电荷从 A 点移到 B 点，电场力作负功</li><li><b>B.</b> 把负电荷从 A 点移到 B 点，电场力作正功</li><li><b>C.</b> 把正电荷从 A 点移到 B 点，电场力作负功</li><li><b>D.</b> 把正电荷从 B 点移到 A 点，电场力作正功</li></ul>","answer":"A","memo":"因 A 点的电势高于 B 点的电势，由 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"E_{p}=q\\varphi\" data-display=\"0\">E_{p}=q\\varphi</span> 知，负电荷在 A 处电势能小于在 B 处电势能，把负电荷从 A 点移到 B 点，电势能增大，电场力做负功，故 A 正确 B 错误；与 A 的分析同理，由 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"E_{p}=q\\varphi\" data-display=\"0\">E_{p}=q\\varphi</span> 知，正电荷在 A 点的电势能大于在 B 的电势能，把正电荷从 A 点移到 B 点，电场力做正功，把正电荷从 B 点移到 A 点，电场力做负功，故 C 错误 D 错误。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"8","title":"1980年全国高考第 8 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"气体性质","points":["能量的转化及其方向性"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_c809eca0d0555b06815e39daac77402b","body":"把质量为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 的 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0\\UdC\" data-display=\"0\">0\\UdC</span> 的冰放进质量为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"100\\UdC\" data-display=\"0\">100\\UdC</span> 的水中，最后得到温度是 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"10\\UdC\" data-display=\"0\">10\\UdC</span> 的水。如果容器吸热和热量损失均可忽略，那么 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的关系是<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}=9m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}=9m_{2}</span></li><li><b>B.</b> <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}=17m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}=17m_{2}</span></li><li><b>C.</b> <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"6.1m_{1}=m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">6.1m_{1}=m_{2}</span></li><li><b>D.</b> <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}=m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}=m_{2}</span></li></ul>","answer":"D","memo":"水的相变潜热为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=334\\UkJkg\" data-display=\"0\">\\lambda=334\\UkJkg</span>，质量为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 的冰吸热融化后再升温到 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"10\\UdC\" data-display=\"0\">10\\UdC</span> 吸收的热量等于质量为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的水降温至 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"10\\UdC\" data-display=\"0\">10\\UdC</span> 放出的热量，即 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\lambda m_{1}+cm_{1}\\Delta t_{1}=cm_{2}\\Delta t_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">\\lambda m_{1}+cm_{1}\\Delta t_{1}=cm_{2}\\Delta t_{2}</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\Delta t_{1}=10\\UdC\" data-display=\"0\">\\Delta t_{1}=10\\UdC</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\Delta t_{2}=90\\UdC\" data-display=\"0\">\\Delta t_{2}=90\\UdC</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"334m_{1}+4.2m_{1}\\times10=4.2m_{2}\\times90\" data-display=\"0\">334m_{1}+4.2m_{1}\\times10=4.2m_{2}\\times90</span>，化简得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"376m_{1}=378m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">376m_{1}=378m_{2}</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\\approx m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}\\approx m_{2}</span>，故 D 正确。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"9","title":"1980年全国高考第 9 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"气体性质","points":["热力学第一定律"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_99b6d0c48bcf53dcb23e7c3fc4df5655","body":"一定质量的理想气体吸热膨胀，并保持压强不变，则它的内能增加，<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> 它吸收的热量等于内能的增量</li><li><b>B.</b> 它吸收的热量小于内能的增量</li><li><b>C.</b> 它吸收的热量大于内能的增量</li><li><b>D.</b> 它吸收的热量可以大于内能的增量，也可以小于内能的增量</li></ul>","answer":"C","memo":"一定质量的理想气体吸热膨胀，保持压强不变，它的内能增加，又气体对外做功，故吸收的热量大于内能的增加量，故 ABD 错误 C 正确。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"10","title":"1980年全国高考第 10 题 3 分","type":"单选题","chapter":"电磁感应","points":["楞次定律"],"score":"3","flags":[],"id":"q_821d3c7b37c75cb68e5469ff3cd50a8b","body":"如右图所示，一水平放置的矩形闭合线圈 abcd，在细长磁铁的 N 极附近竖直下落，保持 bc 边在纸外，ad 边在纸内，由图中的位置 Ⅰ 经过位置 Ⅱ 到位置 Ⅲ，位置 Ⅰ 和 Ⅲ 都很靠近 Ⅱ。在这个过程中，线圈中感生电流<span class=\"answer-blank\">（　）</span> <div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/af933acf62dc0b705f27a953.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/af933acf62dc0b705f27a953.svg\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div> <ul class=\"choices\"><li><b>A.</b> 沿 abcd 流动</li><li><b>B.</b> 沿 dcba 流动</li><li><b>C.</b> 由 Ⅰ 到 Ⅱ 是沿 abcd 流动，由 Ⅱ 到 Ⅲ 是沿 dcba 流动</li><li><b>D.</b> 由 Ⅰ 到 Ⅱ 是沿 dcba 流动，由 Ⅱ 到 Ⅲ 是沿 abcd 流动</li></ul>","answer":"A","memo":"细长磁铁附近是非匀强磁场，由条形磁铁的磁场分布可知，线圈在位置 Ⅱ 时穿过矩形闭合线圈的磁通量为零。线圈从位置 Ⅰ 到位置 Ⅱ，从下向上穿过 abcd 的磁通量在减少，线圈从位置 Ⅱ 到位置 Ⅲ，从上向下穿过 abcd 的磁通量在增加，由楞次定律和右手螺旋定则可判知感应电流的方向是 abcd，故 A 正确。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"11","title":"1980年全国高考第 11 题 4 分","type":"填空题","chapter":"电路","points":["电动势"],"score":"4","flags":[],"id":"q_b40b542d66e254748263e4c3c25af341","body":"12 个相同的电池联接如图，每一个电池的电动势为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"1.5\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">1.5\\UV</span>，内电阻为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.3\\UO\" data-display=\"0\">0.3\\UO</span>，电池组的总电动势为 <span class=\"answer-blank\">________</span> <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">\\UV</span>，总内电阻为 <span class=\"answer-blank\">________</span> <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\UO\" data-display=\"0\">\\UO</span>。 <div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/23c5baf7fe075b13f2e6356a.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/23c5baf7fe075b13f2e6356a.png\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>","answer":"<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"6\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">6\\UV</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.4\\UO\" data-display=\"0\">0.4\\UO</span>","memo":"每条支路 4 个电池串联，总电动势为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"6\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">6\\UV</span>，三条支路并联电池组总电动势为单条支路电动势，故为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"6\\UV\" data-display=\"0\">6\\UV</span>；同时由于单个电池内阻为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.3\\UO\" data-display=\"0\">0.3\\UO</span>，故单条支路总内阻为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"1.2\\UO\" data-display=\"0\">1.2\\UO</span>，三条支路并联，并联内阻为其 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{1}{3}</span>，故为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.4\\UO\" data-display=\"0\">0.4\\UO</span>。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"12","title":"1980年全国高考第 12 题 4 分","type":"填空题","chapter":"原子和原子核","points":["天然放射性"],"score":"4","flags":[],"id":"q_a8590955fb5f5d50b8c34e99b45e1242","body":"<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\ce{^{238}_{92}U}\" data-display=\"0\">\\ce{^{238}_{92}U}</span> 衰变成 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\ce{^{222}_{86}Rn}\" data-display=\"0\">\\ce{^{222}_{86}Rn}</span>，共发生了 <span class=\"answer-blank\">________</span> 次 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"0\">\\alpha</span> 衰变，<span class=\"answer-blank\">________</span> 次 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"0\">\\beta</span> 衰变。","answer":"4，2","memo":"核反应方程满足核电荷数和质量数守恒，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\ce{^{238}_{92}U}\" data-display=\"0\">\\ce{^{238}_{92}U}</span> 衰变为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\ce{^{222}_{86}Rn}\" data-display=\"0\">\\ce{^{222}_{86}Rn}</span>，设经过了 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m\" data-display=\"0\">m</span> 次 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"0\">\\alpha</span> 衰变，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"n\" data-display=\"0\">n</span> 次 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"0\">\\beta</span> 衰变，由核电荷数和质量数守恒得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"92=86+2m-n\" data-display=\"0\">92=86+2m-n</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"238=222+4m\" data-display=\"0\">238=222+4m</span>，解得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m=4\" data-display=\"0\">m=4</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"n=2\" data-display=\"0\">n=2</span>，故发生了 4 次 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"0\">\\alpha</span> 衰变，2 次 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"0\">\\beta</span> 衰变。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"13","title":"1980年全国高考第 13 题 4 分","type":"填空题","chapter":"光学","points":["光的电磁说"],"score":"4","flags":[],"id":"q_48e6ed32017358e7977355e69048372e","body":"一束光自真空射入玻璃。已知光在真空中的波长为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.60\\Uum\" data-display=\"0\">0.60\\Uum</span>，传播速度为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"3.0\\times10^{8}\\Ums\" data-display=\"0\">3.0\\times10^{8}\\Ums</span>，玻璃的折射率为 1.5。则光进入玻璃后的波长为 <span class=\"answer-blank\">________</span>，频率为 <span class=\"answer-blank\">________</span><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\UHz\" data-display=\"0\">\\UHz</span>。","answer":"<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"4\\times10^{-5}\\Ucm\" data-display=\"0\">4\\times10^{-5}\\Ucm</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"5\\times10^{14}\\UHz\" data-display=\"0\">5\\times10^{14}\\UHz</span>","memo":"由 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"n=\\frac{c}{v}=\\frac{\\lambda_{0}}{\\lambda}\" data-display=\"0\">n=\\frac{c}{v}=\\frac{\\lambda_{0}}{\\lambda}</span> 得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\frac{\\lambda_{0}}{n}=\\frac{0.60\\times10^{-6}}{1.5}=0.40\\times10^{-6}=0.40\\Uum\" data-display=\"0\">\\lambda=\\frac{\\lambda_{0}}{n}=\\frac{0.60\\times10^{-6}}{1.5}=0.40\\times10^{-6}=0.40\\Uum</span>。 又 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"c=\\lambda_{0}\\nu\" data-display=\"0\">c=\\lambda_{0}\\nu</span>，故 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\nu=\\frac{c}{\\lambda_{0}}=\\frac{3\\times10^{8}}{0.60\\times10^{-6}}\\UHz=5\\times10^{14}\\UHz\" data-display=\"0\">\\nu=\\frac{c}{\\lambda_{0}}=\\frac{3\\times10^{8}}{0.60\\times10^{-6}}\\UHz=5\\times10^{14}\\UHz</span>。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"14","title":"1980年全国高考第 14 题 4 分","type":"填空题","chapter":"功和能","points":["机械能守恒定律"],"score":"4","flags":[],"id":"q_8488f95e019b54a7994bd3a91b65f629","body":"一个小物体从光滑半球的顶点滑下，初速度很小，可以忽略不计，球半径为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"0.40\\Um\" data-display=\"0\">0.40\\Um</span>，物体落地时速度的大小是 <span class=\"answer-blank\">________</span> <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\Ums\" data-display=\"0\">\\Ums</span>。 <div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/41173ac53238a605e24e2bc7.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/41173ac53238a605e24e2bc7.svg\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>","answer":"<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"2.8\\Ums\" data-display=\"0\">2.8\\Ums</span>","memo":"小球在运动过程中只有重力做功，由机械能守恒得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"mgR=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}\" data-display=\"0\">mgR=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}</span>，解得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v=2\\sqrt{2}\\Ums\\approx2.8\\Ums\" data-display=\"0\">v=2\\sqrt{2}\\Ums\\approx2.8\\Ums</span>。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"15","title":"1980年全国高考第 15 题 4 分","type":"填空题","chapter":"气体性质","points":["玻意耳定律"],"score":"4","flags":[],"id":"q_e5ccdb40286356d4b5cfe94dba7b19d7","body":"在标准状态下，一细长而均匀的玻璃管，上端开口，一段长度为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"38\\Ucm\" data-display=\"0\">38\\Ucm</span> 的水银柱，把一定量的空气封闭在管内。当玻璃管跟竖直方向成 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"60^{\\circ}\" data-display=\"0\">60^{\\circ}</span> 时，管内空气柱的长度为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"60\\Ucm\" data-display=\"0\">60\\Ucm</span>。如果使管竖立，在管内空气达到平衡状态后，这段空气柱的长度是 <span class=\"answer-blank\">________</span> <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\Ucm\" data-display=\"0\">\\Ucm</span>。 <div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/78b663419bfe672908c82450.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/78b663419bfe672908c82450.png\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>","answer":"<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"50\\Ucm\" data-display=\"0\">50\\Ucm</span>","memo":"设倾斜时管内空气的压强为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"p_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">p_{1}</span>，竖直时管内空气的压强为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"p_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">p_{2}</span>，玻璃管的横截面积为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"S\" data-display=\"0\">S</span>，水银的密度为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\rho\" data-display=\"0\">\\rho</span>，由液柱受力平衡得<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"p_{1}S=p_{0}S+\\rho gh\\sin30^{\\circ}S\" data-display=\"0\">p_{1}S=p_{0}S+\\rho gh\\sin30^{\\circ}S</span>，<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"p_{2}S=p_{0}S+\\rho ghS\" data-display=\"0\">p_{2}S=p_{0}S+\\rho ghS</span>，<br><br>其中，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"p_{0}\" data-display=\"0\">p_{0}</span> 为标准大气压，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"p_{0}=76\\UcmHg\" data-display=\"0\">p_{0}=76\\UcmHg</span>，水银柱的长度为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"h=38\\Ucm\" data-display=\"0\">h=38\\Ucm</span>。<br><br>对管内空气，由玻意耳定律得<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"p_{1}lS=p_{2}l&#x27;S\" data-display=\"0\">p_{1}lS=p_{2}l'S</span>，<br><br>其中 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l\" data-display=\"0\">l</span>、<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">l'</span> 分别表示倾斜和竖直状态空气柱的长度，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l=60\\Ucm\" data-display=\"0\">l=60\\Ucm</span>。<br><br>联立各式并代入数据解得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l&#x27;=50\\Ucm\" data-display=\"0\">l'=50\\Ucm</span>。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"16","title":"1980年全国高考第 16 题 10 分","type":"简答题","chapter":"光学","points":["透镜"],"score":"10","flags":[],"id":"q_96a56962a89355b3b6cff18873cc4af0","body":"在薄凸透镜成像中，设 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"u\" data-display=\"0\">u</span> 表示物距，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 表示像距，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"f\" data-display=\"0\">f</span> 表示透镜的焦距。试证明薄凸透镜成像的公式为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}=\\frac{1}{f}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}=\\frac{1}{f}</span>（可只证明成实像的情况）。再根据上式找出像距 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 为正负值的条件，并指出它跟像的虚实的关系。","answer":"<ol class=\"subquestions\"><li>绘出凸透镜成像的光路图。</li><li>证明见解析。</li><li>当 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"u&gt;f\" data-display=\"0\">u&gt;f</span> 时，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 为正值，所成的是实像；当 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"u&lt;f\" data-display=\"0\">u&lt;f</span> 时，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 为负值，所成的是虚像。</li></ol>","memo":"（1）绘出凸透镜成像的光路图。<br><br><div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/fcfc670ab25933013d0201c9.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/fcfc670ab25933013d0201c9.png\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div><br><br>（2）从光路图中可以看出<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\Delta ABO\\sim\\Delta A&#x27;B&#x27;O\" data-display=\"0\">\\Delta ABO\\sim\\Delta A'B'O</span>，得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{AB}{A&#x27;B&#x27;}=\\frac{BO}{B&#x27;O}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{AB}{A'B'}=\\frac{BO}{B'O}</span>；①<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\Delta O&#x27;OF&#x27;\\sim\\Delta A&#x27;B&#x27;F&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">\\Delta O'OF'\\sim\\Delta A'B'F'</span>，得 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{O&#x27;O}{A&#x27;B&#x27;}=\\frac{O&#x27;F&#x27;}{B&#x27;F&#x27;}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{O'O}{A'B'}=\\frac{O'F'}{B'F'}</span>；②<br><br>由于 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"AB=O&#x27;O\" data-display=\"0\">AB=O'O</span>，因此<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{BO}{B&#x27;O}=\\frac{OF&#x27;}{B&#x27;F&#x27;}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{BO}{B'O}=\\frac{OF'}{B'F'}</span>；<br><br>由于 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"BO=u\" data-display=\"0\">BO=u</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"B&#x27;O=v\" data-display=\"0\">B'O=v</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"OF&#x27;=f\" data-display=\"0\">OF'=f</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"B&#x27;F&#x27;=v-f\" data-display=\"0\">B'F'=v-f</span>，因此<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{u}{v}=\\frac{f}{v-f}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{u}{v}=\\frac{f}{v-f}</span>；③<br><br>化简后可得<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}=\\frac{1}{f}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}=\\frac{1}{f}</span>。④<br><br>这就是所要证明的薄凸透镜成像的公式。<br><br>（3）从上式可得：<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"\\frac{1}{v}=\\frac{1}{f}-\\frac{1}{u}=\\frac{u-f}{fu}\" data-display=\"0\">\\frac{1}{v}=\\frac{1}{f}-\\frac{1}{u}=\\frac{u-f}{fu}</span>。<br><br>由于 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"fu\" data-display=\"0\">fu</span> 总是正值，如果 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"u&gt;f\" data-display=\"0\">u&gt;f</span>，即物体位于焦点之外，则 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 为正值，所成的是实像；如果 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"u&lt;f\" data-display=\"0\">u&lt;f</span>，即物体位于焦点之内，则 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 为负值，所成的是虚像。<br><br>评分说明：全题 10 分。（1）2 分，（2）4 分，（3）4 分。<br><br>（2）中，只找出相似三角形并列出①、②式的给 1 分，进一步导出③式的，再给 2 分。<br><br>（3）中，只找出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 为正负值的条件的，给 2 分；没有找出上述条件，只是写出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 为正值时成实像、<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 为负值时成虚像的，给 2 分。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"17","title":"1980年全国高考第 17 题 12 分","type":"计算题","chapter":"磁场","points":["带电粒子在复合场中的运动"],"score":"12","flags":[],"id":"q_f2ca7d9b1c315e198f42918d4417b706","body":"如右图所示，一束具有各种速率的带一个基本正电荷的两种铜离子，质量数分别为 63 和 65，水平地经小孔 S 进入有匀强电场和匀强磁场的区域。电场 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"E\" data-display=\"0\">E</span> 的方向向下，磁场 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"B\" data-display=\"0\">B</span> 的方向垂直纸面向里。只有那些路径不发生偏折的离子才能通过另一个小孔 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"S&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">S'</span>。为了把从 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"S&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">S'</span> 射出的两种铜离子分开，再让它们进入另一方向垂直纸面向外的匀强磁场 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"B&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">B'</span> 中，使两种离子分别沿不同半径的圆形轨道运动。试分别求出两种离子的轨道半径。（应明确说明演算过程的物理上的根据）<br><br>已知：<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"E=1.00\\times10^{5}\\UVm\" data-display=\"0\">E=1.00\\times10^{5}\\UVm</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"B=0.4\\UT\" data-display=\"0\">B=0.4\\UT</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"B&#x27;=0.50\\UT\" data-display=\"0\">B'=0.50\\UT</span>，基本电荷 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"e=1.60\\times10^{-19}\\UC\" data-display=\"0\">e=1.60\\times10^{-19}\\UC</span>，质量数为 63 的铜原子的质量 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}=63\\times1.66\\times10^{-27}\\Ukg\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}=63\\times1.66\\times10^{-27}\\Ukg</span>，质量数为 65 的铜原子的质量 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}=65\\times1.66\\times10^{-27}\\Ukg\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}=65\\times1.66\\times10^{-27}\\Ukg</span>。 <div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/8b28303b5123edc5cdb0a918.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/8b28303b5123edc5cdb0a918.png\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>","answer":"<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{1}\\approx0.33\\Um\" data-display=\"0\">R_{1}\\approx0.33\\Um</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{2}\\approx0.34\\Um\" data-display=\"0\">R_{2}\\approx0.34\\Um</span>","memo":"（1）设铜离子的电量为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"e\" data-display=\"0\">e</span>，以速度 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 进入小孔 S 后，受到的力有电场力 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F_{1}=eE\" data-display=\"0\">F_{1}=eE</span>，方向向下，洛伦兹力 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F_{2}=evB\" data-display=\"0\">F_{2}=evB</span>，方向向上，重力可忽略不计，只有当 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F_{1}=F_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">F_{1}=F_{2}</span> 时，铜离子才能匀速无偏折地穿出小孔 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"S&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">S'</span>。因此，从小孔 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"S&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">S'</span> 穿出的铜离子必须满足的条件是：<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"eE=evB\" data-display=\"0\">eE=evB</span>。①<br><br>这就是说，只有速度 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v=\\frac{E}{B}\" data-display=\"0\">v=\\frac{E}{B}</span> 的铜离子能穿出小孔 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"S&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">S'</span>。<br><br>（2）铜离子进入磁场 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"B&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">B'</span> 后，受到洛伦兹力 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F=evB&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">F=evB'</span>，重力仍可忽略不计。<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span> 跟 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 垂直并为一恒量，因此铜离子在磁场 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"B&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">B'</span> 内将作匀速圆周运动，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span> 就是这种圆周运动的向心力，设铜 63 离子和铜 65 离子运动轨迹的半径分别为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{2}</span>，那么，<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"evB&#x27;=m_{1}\\frac{v^{2}}{R_{1}}\" data-display=\"0\">evB'=m_{1}\\frac{v^{2}}{R_{1}}</span>；②<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"evB&#x27;=m_{2}\\frac{v^{2}}{R_{2}}\" data-display=\"0\">evB'=m_{2}\\frac{v^{2}}{R_{2}}</span>。③<br><br>（3）由①、②两式可得：<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{1}=\\frac{m_{1}E}{eBB&#x27;}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{1}=\\frac{m_{1}E}{eBB'}</span>；④<br><br>由①、③两式可得：<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{2}=\\frac{m_{2}E}{eBB&#x27;}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{2}=\\frac{m_{2}E}{eBB'}</span>。⑤<br><br>代入数值进行计算，<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{1}=\\frac{63\\times1.66\\times10^{-27}\\times1.00\\times10^{5}}{1.60\\times10^{-19}\\times0.40\\times0.50}\\Um=0.33\\Um\" data-display=\"0\">R_{1}=\\frac{63\\times1.66\\times10^{-27}\\times1.00\\times10^{5}}{1.60\\times10^{-19}\\times0.40\\times0.50}\\Um=0.33\\Um</span>，<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{2}=\\frac{65\\times1.66\\times10^{-27}\\times1.00\\times10^{5}}{1.60\\times10^{-19}\\times0.40\\times0.50}\\Um=0.34\\Um\" data-display=\"0\">R_{2}=\\frac{65\\times1.66\\times10^{-27}\\times1.00\\times10^{5}}{1.60\\times10^{-19}\\times0.40\\times0.50}\\Um=0.34\\Um</span>。<br><br>评分说明：全题 12 分。（1）4 分，（2）4 分，（3）4 分。<br><br>（1）中，能正确写出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">F_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">F_{2}</span> 的表达式并指明方向的，各给 1 分。未说明重力可忽略不计的不扣分；能进一步指出只有当 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">F_{1}</span> 跟 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">F_{2}</span> 平衡时，铜离子才能穿出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"S&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">S'</span>，并列出①式的，再给 2 分；没有任何说明直接列出①式的，只给 2 分。<br><br>（2）中，只写出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span> 的表达式并指出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span> 跟 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 垂直的，给 1 分；进一步说明 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span> 就是向心力的，再给 1 分；进一步列出②、③两式的，再各给 1 分，没有任何说明直接列出②、③两式的，给 3 分。<br><br>（3）中，只导出④、⑤两式的，各给 1 分；单纯数字计算错误的，扣 1 分；答案中未写单位或单位错误的，扣 1 分。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"18","title":"1980年全国高考第 18 题 14 分","type":"实验题","chapter":"电路","points":["电路实验"],"score":"14","flags":[],"id":"q_8e614a8b091d5b6b9a722edcf65fb606","body":"右图表示用惠斯登电桥来测量未知电阻 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{x}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{x}</span>。图中 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R\" data-display=\"0\">R</span> 是已知电阻；K 是电键；G 是电流计；AC 是一条粗细均匀的长直电阻丝；D 是滑动触头，按下时就使电流计的一端与电阻丝接通；L 是米尺。 <ol class=\"subquestions\"><li>简要说明测量 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{x}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{x}</span> 的实验步骤（其中要写出计算 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{x}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{x}</span> 的公式）。</li><li>如果滑动触头 D 在从 A 向 C 移动的整个过程中，每次按下 D 时，流过 G 的电流总是比前一次增大，已知 AC 间的电阻丝是导通的，那么，电路可能在什么地方断路了？说明理由。（分析时可认为电池内电阻和电阻 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R&#x27;\" data-display=\"0\">R'</span> 均可忽略）。</li></ol> <div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/9d0fd01376525611bef4d326.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/9d0fd01376525611bef4d326.png\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>","answer":"<ol class=\"subquestions\"><li>①按下电键 K，把滑动触头放在 AC 中点附近，按下 D，观察电流计 G 中指针偏转方向；②向左或向右移动 D，直到按下 D 时 G 的指针不偏转为止；③用米尺量出此时 AD、DC 的长度 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">l_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">l_{2}</span>；④根据公式 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{x}=\\frac{l_{2}}{l_{1}}R\" data-display=\"0\">R_{x}=\\frac{l_{2}}{l_{1}}R</span> 计算出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{x}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{x}</span> 的值。</li><li>BC 间发生了断路。</li></ol>","memo":"（1）实验步骤：①按下电键 K，把滑动触头放在 AC 中点附近，按下 D，观察电流计 G 中指针偏转方向；②向左或向右移动 D，直到按下 D 时 G 的指针不偏转为止；③用米尺量出此时 AD、DC 的长度 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">l_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">l_{2}</span>；④根据公式 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{x}=\\frac{l_{2}}{l_{1}}R\" data-display=\"0\">R_{x}=\\frac{l_{2}}{l_{1}}R</span> 计算出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{x}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{x}</span> 的值。<br><br>（2）BC 间发生了断路。<br><br>理由：此时的等效电路如图所示，D 向右移动 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{1}</span> 增大，AD 间的电阻 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathrm{AD}}=\\frac{R_{1}R_{3}}{R_{1}+R_{3}}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{\\mathrm{AD}}=\\frac{R_{1}R_{3}}{R_{1}+R_{3}}</span> 也增大，其中 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{3}=R+R_{G}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{3}=R+R_{G}</span>；<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{G}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{G}</span> 是电流计内电阻，同时 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{2}</span> 减小。于是加在 AD 间的电压 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathrm{AD}}=\\frac{R_{\\mathrm{AD}}E}{R_{\\mathrm{AD}}+R_{2}}=\\frac{E}{1+\\frac{R_{2}}{R_{\\mathrm{AD}}}}\" data-display=\"0\">U_{\\mathrm{AD}}=\\frac{R_{\\mathrm{AD}}E}{R_{\\mathrm{AD}}+R_{2}}=\\frac{E}{1+\\frac{R_{2}}{R_{\\mathrm{AD}}}}</span><br><br><div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/3a5ed9fb5afee70ce11a9680.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/3a5ed9fb5afee70ce11a9680.png\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div><br><br>也增大，这就使流过电流计 G 的电流增大。<br><br>评分说明：全题 14 分。（1）8 分，（2）6 分。<br><br>（1）中，步骤①2 分，未写“按下 K”，或未写“按下 D，观察 G 中指针偏转方向”的，各扣 1 分；步骤②3 分，在按下 D 时未写“直到 G 的指针不偏转”的不给分，漏写按下 D 的，扣 1 分；步骤③1 分；步骤④2 分，未写 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{x}=\\frac{l_{2}}{l_{1}}R\" data-display=\"0\">R_{x}=\\frac{l_{2}}{l_{1}}R</span> 的，不给分。<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">l_{1}</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"l_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">l_{2}</span> 用 AD、DC 表示也可以。如果步骤①的全部或部分内容与步骤②合并写出，不因此而扣分。<br><br>（2）中，写出断路位置，给 2 分，说明理由，给 4 分。理由的说明中，只写出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathrm{AD}}\" data-display=\"0\">R_{\\mathrm{AD}}</span> 随 D 的右移而增大的，给 2 分。用分压原理说明了随 D 的右移 AD 间的电压增大，因而流过 G 的电流增大的，给 4 分。说明理由中，只要基本点都已说到，无概念错误，但叙述层次不清、文句不够通顺的，这次考试暂不扣分，明显的概念错误可酌情扣分。"},{"paper":"1980/全国","year":1980,"region":"全国","number":"19","title":"1980年全国高考第 19 题 14 分","type":"计算题","chapter":"运动和力","points":["牛顿定律的应用"],"score":"14","flags":[],"id":"q_172ac28b73485635b7ba373a39c39e00","body":"有两个物体，质量分别为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span>。<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 原来静止，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 以速度 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 向右运动，如图所示。 <ol class=\"subquestions\"><li>它们同时开始受到向右的大小相同的恒力 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span>，在 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}&lt;m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}&lt;m_{2}</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}=m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}=m_{2}</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}&gt;m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}&gt;m_{2}</span> 三种情况下，它们能否达到相同的速度（矢量）？</li><li>试列出它们速度的表达式，并根据此式分别进行讨论，讨论中要注意说明理由。</li><li>如果它们受到的恒力 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span> 的方向都跟 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 垂直，它们能否达到相同的速度（矢量）？为什么？</li></ol> <div class=\"figures\"><figure><a href=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/b182d82da92432ccd7327e86.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/gaokao-bank/data/images/b182d82da92432ccd7327e86.svg\" alt=\"试题配图\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>","answer":"<ol class=\"subquestions\"><li><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{1}=\\frac{F}{m_{1}}t\" data-display=\"0\">v_{1}=\\frac{F}{m_{1}}t</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{2}=v+\\frac{F}{m_{2}}t\" data-display=\"0\">v_{2}=v+\\frac{F}{m_{2}}t</span>。</li><li>见解析。</li><li>不能达到相同的速度。</li></ol>","memo":"（1）设受力后 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 的加速度为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"a_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">a_{1}</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的加速度为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"a_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">a_{2}</span>，受力后某一时刻 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"t\" data-display=\"0\">t</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 的速度为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">v_{1}</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的速度为 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">v_{2}</span>，那么：<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"a_{1}=\\frac{F}{m_{1}}\" data-display=\"0\">a_{1}=\\frac{F}{m_{1}}</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"a_{2}=\\frac{F}{m_{2}}\" data-display=\"0\">a_{2}=\\frac{F}{m_{2}}</span>；<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{1}=a_{1}t=\\frac{F}{m_{1}}t\" data-display=\"0\">v_{1}=a_{1}t=\\frac{F}{m_{1}}t</span>；①<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{2}=v+a_{2}t=v+\\frac{F}{m_{2}}t\" data-display=\"0\">v_{2}=v+a_{2}t=v+\\frac{F}{m_{2}}t</span>。②<br><br>（2）受力后，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 做初速为零的匀加速运动，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 做有一定初速度的匀加速运动，它们的加速度和速度的方向都是向右的。<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}&lt;m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}&lt;m_{2}</span> 时，由于 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"a_{1}&gt;a_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">a_{1}&gt;a_{2}</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 的速度增加得比 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的快，虽然 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 已有一定初速度，它们仍可在某一时刻达到相同的速度。<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}=m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}=m_{2}</span> 时，由于 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"a_{1}=a_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">a_{1}=a_{2}</span>，它们的速度增加得一样快，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 已有一初速度 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span>，因此 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 的速度将总是比 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的速度小 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span>，它们不可能达到相同的速度。<br><br><span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}&gt;m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}&gt;m_{2}</span> 时，由于 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"a_{1}&lt;a_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">a_{1}&lt;a_{2}</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 的速度增加得比 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的慢，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 已有一初速度，因此 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 的速度将越来越小于 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的速度，它们也不可能达到相同的速度。<br><br>（3）如果 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span> 跟 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 垂直，那么，<span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span> 的作用只是使 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 在垂直于 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 的方向上的速度增加，而对它们在 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 方向的即向右的速度没有影响。因此 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 将始终没有向右的速度分量，而 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 将在向右的方向上始终保持速度 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span>。这样，在任何时刻 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 的速度方向都不会相同，因此它们不可能达到相同的速度。<br><br>评分说明：全题 14 分。（1）2 分，（2）7 分，（3）5 分。<br><br>（1）未写出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{1}=\\frac{F}{m_{1}}t\" data-display=\"0\">v_{1}=\\frac{F}{m_{1}}t</span> 或 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{2}=v+a_{2}t=v+\\frac{F}{m_{2}}t\" data-display=\"0\">v_{2}=v+a_{2}t=v+\\frac{F}{m_{2}}t</span> 的，各扣 1 分。<br><br>（2）中，正确说明了 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 受力后的运动情况的，给 3 分，但说明中未明确指出加速度和速度方向的，扣 1 分；对三种情况的讨论，每个正确解答给 2 分；对 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}=m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}=m_{2}</span> 的讨论中未说到 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">v_{1}</span> 总比 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">v_{2}</span> 小 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 的，对 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}&gt;m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}&gt;m_{2}</span> 的讨论中未说到 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">v_{1}</span> 比 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">v_{2}</span> 越来越小的，均不扣分。<br><br>（3）中，未指出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"F\" data-display=\"0\">F</span> 对 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v\" data-display=\"0\">v</span> 方向上的速度没有影响的，扣 2 分；未指出 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">v_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">v_{2}</span> 的方向不可能相同的，扣 3 分。<br><br>考生也可以根据①、②两式，设 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"v_{1}=v_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">v_{1}=v_{2}</span>，求出它们速度相等的时间 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"t=\\frac{mv_{1}v_{2}}{m_{2}-m_{1}}\" data-display=\"0\">t=\\frac{mv_{1}v_{2}}{m_{2}-m_{1}}</span> 后进行讨论，从 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"t\" data-display=\"0\">t</span> 有正解、无解或负解来说明 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{1}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{1}</span> 和 <span class=\"math-tex\" data-tex=\"m_{2}\" data-display=\"0\">m_{2}</span> 能否达到相同的速度，只要说理正确，应同样给分。答卷中只要基本点都已说到，无概念错误，但叙述层次不清、文句不够通顺的，这次考试暂不扣分，明显的概念错误可酌情扣分。"}]}
